1. Recruitment Metrics
    Metric	                                            Formula
Time to Hire	                        Date of Offer Acceptance − Date of Application
Time to Fill	                        Date Position Filled − Date Requisition Approved
Cost per Hire                 	Total Recruitment Cost ÷ Number of Hires
Offer Acceptance Rate	(Offers Accepted ÷ Total Offers Made) × 100
Selection Ratio	              (Number of Candidates Selected ÷ Total Candidates Applied) × 100
Source of Hire	             (Hires from a Particular Source ÷ Total Hires) × 100

2. Employee Turnover & Retention Metrics
Metric	                                                          Formula
Employee Turnover Rate	           (Number of Employees Separated ÷ Average Employee Headcount) × 100
Average Headcount	                 (Opening Headcount + Closing Headcount) ÷ 2
Retention Rate	                     (Employees at End who were Present at Beginning ÷ Employees at Beginning) × 100
Voluntary Turnover Rate	     (Voluntary Resignations ÷ Average Headcount) × 100
Involuntary Turnover Rate	(Involuntary Separations ÷ Average Headcount) × 100
New Hire Turnover Rate	(New Employees Leaving Within a Defined Period ÷ Total New Hires in That Cohort) × 100

3. Attendance & Absenteeism Metrics
Metric	                                             Formula
Absenteeism Rate	(Total Absent Working Days ÷ Total Available Working Days) × 100
Attendance Rate	(Total Days Present ÷ Total Available Working Days) × 100
Absence Frequency Rate	(Number of Absence Instances ÷ Average Headcount) × 100
Lost Time Rate	(Total Hours Lost Due to Absence ÷ Total Scheduled Working Hours) × 100
Overtime Rate	(Total Overtime Hours ÷ Total Scheduled Working Hours) × 100

4. Training & Development Metrics
Metric                                	Formula
Training Cost per Employee	Total Training Cost ÷ Number of Employees Trained
Training Hours per Employee	Total Training Hours ÷ Average Employee Headcount
Training Completion Rate	(Employees Completing Training ÷ Employees Enrolled) × 100
Training Effectiveness	(Post-Training Assessment Score − Pre-Training Assessment Score) ÷ Pre-Training Assessment Score × 100
Training ROI	[(Monetary Benefits from Training − Training Cost) ÷ Training Cost] × 100
